\end{subfigure}

\begin{subfigure}[t]{ }

\end{subfigure}

\subimport{tables}{quantile_output_type}

\subimport{tables}{gen-length-analysis}

We classify each post-patch generation into one of seven output types (Table~\ref{tab:output_types}) and jointly examine their distribution and PSR across token roles (Figure~\ref{fig:gen-type-analysis}) and step-position quartiles (Table~\ref{tab:llama-step-generation-psr}).

