**Patch target**

For each failed sample (target), we select a class-matched donor from the same-$N$ success pool and from the clean $N{=}2$ success pool. The donor's hidden state at the probe-best layer $\ell_{\mathrm{probe}}$ is injected into the target's forward pass by replacing the last-token activation at a patch layer $\ell_{\mathrm{patch}}$ via a PyTorch forward hook:

\begin{equation}
 h^{(\ell_{\mathrm{patch}})}_{-1} \;\leftarrow\; h^{(\ell_{\mathrm{probe}})}_{\mathrm{donor}},
\end{equation}

